<title>UK: CalEnergy has 3.4 pct Northern acceptances.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy has 3.4 pct Northern acceptances.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalEnergy Co Inc said on Tuesday that it had received acceptances in its bid for UK regional electricity company Northern Electric Plc representing 3.4 percent of Northern's ordinary shares.</p>
<p>CE Electric UK Plc, a subsidiary of CalEnergy, which mounted a 630 pence a share hostile bid for Northern last month, said it had exended its offer until December 10.</p>
<p>In addition to the acceptances, CE Electric holds a further 28.72 percent of Northern's shares, which it bought in the market, giving it a total of 32.12 percent.</p>
</text>
